    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あんたはどうして\r\n自分のことには鈍いのかしらね……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それとも、本当はふゆのこともわかってない？",
    "charAnim1": "shrug",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "今の正解は、『俺の手柄でもあるだろ』よ\r\n自分の仕事はしっかり主張しなさい",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、でも──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆがここまで誰と二人三脚してきたか、\r\nわからないとは言わせないわよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆが評価されてるなら、\r\nそれは同時にあんたへの評価でもあるの",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018011040110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆをここまで仕上げた、あんたへのね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801104/2018011040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
